# PROMENADE EDGE: on the Embarcadero north of Pier 7, an ollie onto the first of the granite edges along the
# promenade (0.45 m high, 24 m long, 4 m apart) and a 50-50 to its end. The squeezed city re-homes the edges
# to the seawall in front of Pier 7 (a 24 m run south-east of it, a shorter one north-west), level where
# today's falls 0.13 m along the run, so the grind takes 0.35 s longer.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 604.34 871.46 -8.97 344.0
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x -1.656
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y 5.767
hold ollie 48..78
tap grind 84..148 every 4
bot balance
run 1000
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=ledge_604_875} within 84..88
expect event grindEnd{reason=end} within 801..805
expect event gap{id=promenade_edge,gap=PROMENADE EDGE,points=250} within 801..805
expect event land{quality=clean} within 855..859
expect no event bail
expect no event wallrideStart
expect event goalComplete{id=promenade,name=Grind the Promenade} within 801..805
